title: Obfuscated PowerShell (Invoke-Obfuscation Style)
id: 984b6828-c24b-4fe3-ba51-58165c17d894
status: experimental
description: Detects heavily obfuscated PowerShell characteristic of Invoke-Obfuscation, such as string reversal, format-operator reassembly, backtick splitting, and char-code concatenation used to evade signatures.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1027/010/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    CommandLine|contains:
      - '-join'
      - '[char]'
      - '`'
      - '.Invoke('
      - '-f '
    CommandLine|contains:
      - '${'
      - 'chr('
      - '[string]::join'
      - 'ToCharArray'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - ParentImage
falsepositives:
  - Complex but legitimate scripts
level: high
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1027.010
